<!doctype html><html lang="tr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Hesap silme · Döngü</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f7f2;color:#173629;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.top{background:#123326;color:#fff;padding:24px}.brand{max-width:720px;margin:auto;font-size:24px;font-weight:900}.brand b{color:#dff35b}.page{max-width:720px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5df;border-radius:26px;padding:clamp(22px,5vw,42px);box-shadow:0 18px 55px #15382a12}h1{font-size:36px;line-height:1.1;margin:8px 0 14px}.eyebrow{color:#257451;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.4px}.lead,.note{color:#5f7067;line-height:1.7}.box{background:#f2f7f3;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;margin:20px 0}.box li{margin:7px 0}label{display:block;font-weight:800;margin:16px 0 7px}input{width:100%;height:52px;border:1px solid #cdd9d1;border-radius:14px;padding:0 14px;font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box}.check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}.check input{width:20px;height:20px}.check label{margin:0;font-weight:600}button{width:100%;min-height:54px;border:0;border-radius:15px;background:#176b45;color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;margin-top:20px}.errors{background:#fff0ec;color:#9b3f30;border-radius:14px;padding:13px}.success{background:#edf7ef;color:#176b45;border-radius:14px;padding:13px}</style></head><body><header class="top"><div class="brand">döngü<b>.</b></div></header><main class="page"><section class="card"><div class="eyebrow">HESAP VE VERİ KONTROLÜ</div><h1>Döngü hesabını sil</h1><p class="lead">İşlemi uygulamadaki Profil → Hesabımı sil bölümünden doğrudan yapabilirsin. Uygulamaya erişemiyorsan e-posta doğrulamasıyla bu sayfayı kullan.</p><div class="box"><strong>Silinen veriler</strong><ul><li>Ad, e-posta, telefon, avatar, kayıtlı adresler ve cihaz bildirim anahtarları</li><li>Aktif ilanlar ve kesin teslimat konumları</li><li>Bildirilmeyen mesaj iç